  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving living conditions in the exercise of human rights of people in Alta Verapaz</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD&apos;s strategic partner in Guatemala, Pastoral Social Caritas Verapaz, aims to strengthen the empowerment of &quot;population in vulnerability&quot; (especially women, indigenous peoples and people with HIV) in the department of Alta Verapaz, Guatemala, for them to be able to advocate and have access to decision-making processes at the local and national level, as a mechanism for improving their living conditions. This project is merging the previous three projects CAFOD has had with Pastoral Social Caritas Verapaz (GUA153, GUA157 and GUA162) and building on their experience.</narrative>
  </description>
